          "basemap_url": "Tile template with {z}, {x} and {y} placeholders, drawn behind the weather maps. Defaults to the CARTO style Home Assistant itself uses. Leave empty for no basemap. Do not point this at tile.openstreetmap.org: their usage policy forbids it.",
